updateRule:
// Platform operators only.
//
// This rule used to have an owner/admin branch that froze the six max_* limit
// fields and organization, commented "can only change rotate_keys". It was a
// deny-list, and it leaked: it still permitted writes to jwt (the signed account
// JWT), revocations (which user JWTs the account rejects), public_key,
// signing_public_key, signing_keys, name, description and active -- and any field
// added later would have been tenant-writable too, silently.
//
// A rule cannot express "this one field and nothing else", so the three key
// operations an owner/admin legitimately needs moved to a route that sets exactly
